<title>LUXEMBOURG: TENNIS-LUXEMBOURG WOMEN'S CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LUXEMBOURG WOMEN'S CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LUXEMBOURG 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the</p>
<p>$164,250 Luxembourg women's tennis championship on Friday:</p>
<p>Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 4-6</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Anke Huber (Germany) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-2 6-1</p>
</text>
